=You are comparing two advertisers' live Meta ads, read the same way on the same day.

Their proven ads that have no equivalent in ours:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Split Theirs From Yours').all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r.is_gap).map(i => ({ days: i.days_running, offer: i.offer, text: String(i.ad_text || '').slice(0, 240), lands_on: i.landing_domain })).slice(0, 12)) }}

Our own live ads:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Split Theirs From Yours').all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r.side !== 'them').map(i => ({ days: i.days_running, offer: i.offer, text: String(i.ad_text || '').slice(0, 240) })).slice(0, 15)) }}

What you already said about their angles:
{{ $('Name The Angles').first().json.text }}

In under 120 words and no headings: say which of their durable offers has no answer in ours, and which of ours has no equivalent in theirs. Lead with whichever gap has survived the most days of spend, and give the day count. If our list is empty, say plainly that no brand of ours was entered and there is nothing to compare against - do not invent one. If the two sides are running the same offers, say that instead of manufacturing a gap.

